  dialogueEntries:
  - dialogueText: Station security watches every walkway. Keep your blade in its sheath and we won't have problems.
    choiceOptionText: 
    speakerMood: Neutral
  - dialogueText: Bounty hunters are thick in the lower bazaar today. Watch your back.
    choiceOptionText: 
    speakerMood: Neutral
  returnDialogueEntries: []
  waitingDialogueText: Get that Data Core from the refinery terminal across the gantry first, Alita. No core, no coordinates.
