  dialogueEntries:
  - dialogueText: Your blade cuts true, cyborg. Damascus folding absorbs kinetic recoil that would shatter common carbide steel.
    choiceOptionText: 
    speakerMood: Neutral
  - dialogueText: Trust your edge in the storm ahead. Steel does not rust in the vacuum.
    choiceOptionText: 
    speakerMood: Neutral
  returnDialogueEntries: []
  waitingDialogueText: Get that Data Core from the refinery terminal across the gantry first, Alita. No core, no coordinates.
