  dialogueEntries:
  - dialogueText: Madame Zara runs the tightest bazaar in the sector. You want rare Martian contraband, you play by her rules.
    choiceOptionText: 
    speakerMood: Neutral
  - dialogueText: Her informants know every cargo ship that docked in the last forty-eight hours.
